{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["It seemed to us: <b>upon the cover</b> and <b>before the cover</b> according to its plain meaning. The copyists said that <b>upon the cover</b> means between the poles, and <b>before the cover</b> is known from their words — and this is true."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:24.408252758Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}